notes:        From the pack "Sci-fi Sounds (Kenney)" (archive https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/sci-fi-sounds/6b296f9ecf-1677589334/kenney_sci-fi-sounds.zip, sha256 119340f351a5098ad814f78719438c0da355a9ce8a4c8a3af6a8d48aa3d49e04).
